<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 94,249.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 94,249.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of January 16 totaled 94,249 bales, up from 93,383 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 939 bales issued, no decertification orders, 73 cancellations, and 2,136 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
